Translation patch: <Straus as MultiscalarMul>::multiscalar_mul

Change: `map`/`collect` become helpers `lookup_tables`/`scalar_digits`; the `zip` becomes an index loop to the shorter length.
Why: Aeneas only models `Iterator::next` (aeneas#1057). Loops over a generic `IntoIterator` don't extract, hence the nested `It: Iterator` helper.
Behaviour: identical. Non-functional: the digits `Vec` grows by `push`, so freed buffers holding secret digits are not zeroized.
Relies on: `as_radix_16` returns `[i8; 64]`.

